<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>Chewa | Electronics With Proof Beside the Price</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Chewa is a premium electronics marketplace built around specs, reviews, delivery, warranty, protection, and support in one precise storefront."
    />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='14' fill='%230b1220'/%3E%3Ctext x='32' y='44' font-family='monospace' font-size='36' font-weight='700' fill='%23ffffff' text-anchor='middle'%3EC%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/fonts/fonts.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

    <header class="site-header" aria-label="Chewa retail header">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a class="wordmark" href="#" aria-label="Chewa home">
          <span class="wordmark-mark">C</span>
          <span>Chewa</span>
        </a>

        <form class="header-search" role="search">
          <label class="sr-only" for="site-search">Search electronics</label>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&#8981;</span>
          <input id="site-search" name="q" type="search" placeholder="Search laptops, monitors, Wi-Fi 7..." />
        </form>

        <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
          <a href="#categories">Categories</a>
          <a href="#compare">Compare</a>
          <a href="#service">Support</a>
        </nav>

        <a class="cart-chip" href="#checkout" aria-label="Cart status">
          <span class="cart-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>Cart 0</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero section-shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Precision electronics commerce</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Find the right electronics faster&mdash;with the proof beside the price.</h1>
          <p class="hero-subhead">
            Chewa organizes devices by how people actually choose them: specs, reviews, delivery,
            warranty, protection, and support in one precise storefront.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button primary" href="#categories">Start with categories</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="#compare">Compare featured devices</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-proof" aria-label="Chewa proof points">
            <span><strong>4.8</strong> from 12,400 buyers</span>
            <span><strong>2 hr</strong> pickup windows</span>
            <span><strong>30 day</strong> returns</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="discovery-frame reveal" aria-label="The Chewa Discovery Shelf">
          <div class="shelf-grid" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="shelf-top">
              <div class="shelf-search">
                <span>&#8981;</span>
                <span>14-inch laptop, 32GB memory, under $1,600</span>
              </div>
              <div class="status-pill green">Expert chat online</div>
            </div>

            <div class="mini-rail shelf-layer">
              <span>Laptops</span>
              <span>Audio</span>
              <span>Monitors</span>
              <span>Storage</span>
              <span>Networking</span>
            </div>

            <article class="hero-product product-card shelf-layer">
              <img
                src="assets/clean-premium-laptop-and-tablet-product-photography-cool-neutral-background-crisp-retail-lighting-no-people.jpg"
                alt=""
              />
              <div>
                <p class="mono">FEATURED DEVICE</p>
                <h2>AeroBook Pro 14</h2>
                <p>M-series class chip, 18h battery, 1TB SSD</p>
                <div class="price-row">
                  <span class="price">$1,449</span>
                  <span class="rating">4.8 / 5</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <div class="signal-stack shelf-layer">
              <span class="status-pill green">In stock</span>
              <span class="status-pill blue">Free expedited shipping</span>
              <span class="status-pill blue">Pickup today</span>
              <span class="status-pill amber">Protection eligible</span>
              <span class="status-pill">30-day returns</span>
            </div>

            <div class="device-pair shelf-layer">
              <article>
                <img
                  src="assets/premium-headphones-smartphone-monitor-accessories-electronics-marketplace-product-grid-clean-top-down-composition.jpg"
                  alt=""
                />
                <span>StudioDock 27</span>
                <strong>$579</strong>
              </article>
              <article>
                <img
                  src="assets/close-up-modern-electronics-devices-ports-cables-aluminum-black-glass-packaging-details-precise-studio-mood.jpg"
                  alt=""
                />
                <span>PortHub 8K</span>
                <strong>$119</strong>
              </article>
            </div>

            <aside class="checkout-panel shelf-layer">
              <p class="mono">CHECKOUT CONFIDENCE</p>
              <h3>Secure checkout</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Warranty visible before payment</li>
                <li>Shipping estimate: Thu, Aug 6</li>
                <li>Expert chat online</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="checkout-total">
                <span>Shortlist total</span>
                <strong>$2,147</strong>
              </div>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="categories" class="section-shell categories" aria-labelledby="categories-title">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Category rails</p>
          <h2 id="categories-title">Start from the buying question, then narrow by the spec that matters.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="category-rail reveal" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrollable electronics categories">
          <article><span>Laptops</span><strong>OLED + 120Hz</strong><p>Creator-grade displays, long battery, ports that match your desk.</p></article>
          <article><span>Phones</span><strong>5x optical zoom</strong><p>Battery ratings, camera sensors, storage tiers, carrier clarity.</p></article>
          <article><span>Tablets</span><strong>Pencil + keyboard</strong><p>Screen size, stylus latency, app power, repair coverage.</p></article>
          <article><span>Monitors</span><strong>USB-C 96W</strong><p>Color accuracy, refresh rate, ergonomic stands, dock pass-through.</p></article>
          <article><span>Audio</span><strong>ANC + 40h battery</strong><p>Codec support, multipoint pairing, fit style, replacement pads.</p></article>
          <article><span>Gaming</span><strong>240Hz + low latency</strong><p>GPUs, refresh rates, cooling, response time, upgrade paths.</p></article>
          <article><span>Storage</span><strong>2TB NVMe</strong><p>Portable SSDs, backup drives, camera-ready cards, endurance ratings.</p></article>
          <article><span>Smart Home</span><strong>Matter-ready</strong><p>Hubs, cameras, sensors, privacy settings, room-by-room coverage.</p></article>
          <article><span>Networking</span><strong>Wi-Fi 7 mesh</strong><p>Wired backhaul, coverage by room count, router security updates.</p></article>
          <article><span>Cameras</span><strong>4K 120 capture</strong><p>Sensor size, lens mounts, stabilization, card speed needs.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-shell discovery" aria-labelledby="discovery-title">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Product discovery</p>
          <h2 id="discovery-title">Four fast paths into a shortlist that holds up under comparison.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="decision-grid">
          <article class="decision-card reveal">
            <div class="decision-header">
              <h3>For creators</h3>
              <span>Color + export</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tile-stack">
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>AeroBook Pro 14</strong><span>32GB / 1TB / OLED</span><em>In stock &middot; Tue delivery</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>CanvasTab 12</strong><span>P3 display / stylus</span><em>Pickup today</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>ColorView 27</strong><span>5K / 98% DCI-P3</span><em>Ships free</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="decision-card reveal">
            <div class="decision-header">
              <h3>For hybrid work</h3>
              <span>Battery + ports</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tile-stack">
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>TransitBook Air</strong><span>18h / 2.7 lb / LTE</span><em>Thu delivery</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>PortHub 8K</strong><span>HDMI 2.1 / 100W PD</span><em>In stock</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>FocusCam Mini</strong><span>4K / privacy shutter</span><em>Pickup today</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="decision-card reveal">
            <div class="decision-header">
              <h3>For competitive play</h3>
              <span>Frames + cooling</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tile-stack">
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>RiftStation 16</strong><span>RTX class / 240Hz</span><em>Limited stock</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>PulsePanel 27</strong><span>1ms / G-Sync ready</span><em>Tue delivery</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>ZeroLag Keys</strong><span>Hall effect switches</span><em>Ships free</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="decision-card reveal">
            <div class="decision-header">
              <h3>For connected homes</h3>
              <span>Coverage + privacy</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tile-stack">
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>Mesh7 Trio</strong><span>Wi-Fi 7 / 6 rooms</span><em>In stock</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>DoorCam Pro</strong><span>Local storage / HDR</span><em>Fri delivery</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
              <div class="product-tile"><strong>HomeHub Matter</strong><span>Thread / Matter bridge</span><em>Pickup today</em><label><input type="checkbox" /> Compare</label></div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="trust-strip" aria-label="Chewa operational promises">
        <div class="trust-inner reveal">
          <span>Free expedited shipping over $49</span>
          <span>Pickup windows shown before checkout</span>
          <span>30-day returns</span>
          <span>Protection plans shown before checkout</span>
          <span>Live product specialists</span>
          <span>Warranty terms in the product tray</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="compare" class="section-shell compare" aria-labelledby="compare-title">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Featured comparison</p>
          <h2 id="compare-title">A matrix built for the questions electronics buyers actually ask.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="comparison-wrap reveal">
          <table class="comparison-table">
            <caption>Featured device comparison</caption>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Decision point</th>
                <th scope="col">AeroBook Pro 14</th>
                <th scope="col">RiftStation 16</th>
                <th scope="col">TransitBook Air</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><th scope="row">Chip / performance</th><td>M-series class, 12-core GPU</td><td>RTX class graphics, vapor cooling</td><td>Efficiency chip, silent profile</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Display</th><td>14.2 OLED, 120Hz, P3</td><td>16 QHD, 240Hz, matte</td><td>13.6 Retina-class, 500 nits</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Battery</th><td>18h video, 12h mixed work</td><td>8h mixed, 2h performance mode</td><td>20h video, 15h office</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Ports</th><td>3x USB-C, HDMI, SDXC</td><td>USB-C, HDMI 2.1, Ethernet</td><td>2x USB-C, Mag charge</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Warranty</th><td>1 year limited, extendable</td><td>1 year depot, accidental add-on</td><td>1 year limited, express exchange</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Protection</th><td>Eligible: 2 or 3 years</td><td>Eligible: drops + spills</td><td>Eligible: battery service</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Delivery timing</th><td>Free expedited by Thu, Aug 6</td><td>Pickup today in select stores</td><td>Ships tomorrow, arrives Fri</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="service" class="section-shell service" aria-labelledby="service-title">
        <div class="service-media reveal">
          <img
            src="assets/electronics-repair-service-bench-small-tools-device-components-anti-static-mat-warranty-support-atmosphere.jpg"
            alt="Electronics repair bench with small tools and device components"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="service-copy reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Protection and service bay</p>
          <h2 id="service-title">Coverage language that stays plain before you pay.</h2>
          <div class="coverage-grid">
            <article><span class="mono">2 YEARS</span><h3>Repair first</h3><p>Parts and labor for covered failures, with service fees shown beside the plan price.</p></article>
            <article><span class="mono">3 YEARS</span><h3>Replace when repair is slower</h3><p>Replacement or store credit when repair timing misses the promised window.</p></article>
            <article><span class="mono">TRADE-IN</span><h3>Data wipe included</h3><p>Condition estimate, serial check, privacy reset, and wipe confirmation before resale.</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-shell proof" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
        <div class="proof-card reveal">
          <img
            src="assets/boxed-consumer-electronics-shipment-label-protective-packaging-clean-retail-fulfillment-mood.jpg"
            alt="Boxed consumer electronics shipment with clean protective packaging"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Reviews and proof</p>
            <h2 id="proof-title">Buyer ratings and bench notes live in the same decision space.</h2>
            <div class="proof-grid">
              <p><strong>4.8 from 12,400 buyers</strong><span>Ratings filtered by verified purchase, product variant, and ownership length.</span></p>
              <p><strong>Bench-tested for battery, thermals, and display accuracy</strong><span>Expert snippets surface the tradeoffs specs alone hide.</span></p>
              <p><strong>Return reasons shown by category</strong><span>Fit, compatibility, fan noise, panel uniformity, and setup complexity.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="checkout" class="final-cta section-shell" aria-labelledby="checkout-title">
        <div class="final-copy reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Checkout confidence</p>
          <h2 id="checkout-title">Build a shortlist with the delivery date, warranty, and support path already attached.</h2>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button primary" href="#categories">Build your shortlist</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="#compare">Shop ready-to-ship devices</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="final-module reveal" aria-label="Checkout module">
          <div><span>Secure payment</span><strong>Card, wallet, installments</strong></div>
          <div><span>Shipping estimate</span><strong>Thu, Aug 6 &middot; free expedited</strong></div>
          <div><span>Return window</span><strong>30 days from delivery</strong></div>
          <div><span>Warranty option</span><strong>2-year protection from $129</strong></div>
          <div><span>Support</span><strong>Specialist online now</strong></div>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <span>Chewa</span>
      <span>Specs, delivery, warranty, and support in one storefront.</span>
    </footer>

    <script src="assets/vendor/gsap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="assets/vendor/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
    <script src="assets/vendor/lenis.min.js"></script>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
